<title>JAPAN: Tokyo JGB market closed on national holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo JGB market closed on national holiday.</headline>
<text>
<p>*Japanese Government Bond market in Tokyo is closed on Monday due to national holiday. *The market will resume trading on September 24.</p>
